WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:03.800
I am Prince of Jin of Xuan Kingdom

00:03.880 --> 00:05.280
Sikong Yao

00:05.920 --> 00:07.320
Sikong

00:08.080 --> 00:09.560
He's Xuan Kingdom royalty

00:09.760 --> 00:11.440
Send men immediately

00:12.360 --> 00:13.800
If we capture him

00:13.920 --> 00:16.360
The battle can still turn

00:17.720 --> 00:18.960
Capture him alive

00:19.040 --> 00:21.400
Kill

00:28.400 --> 00:30.440
Zu Kun, pressured by the court,

00:30.680 --> 00:32.800
Had no choice but to halt the Northern Expedition.

00:33.200 --> 00:35.200
As a bargaining chip to cease hostilities and withdraw troops,

00:35.300 --> 00:37.800
You were safely sent back to the south.

00:38.600 --> 00:39.400
However,

00:39.500 --> 00:40.800
Shortly thereafter,

00:40.900 --> 00:44.400
The claim that the Northern Expedition's failure was entirely your fault alone

00:44.500 --> 00:47.500
Spread like wildfire across the entire realm.

01:06.360 --> 01:07.760
Your Highness...

01:14.560 --> 01:16.893
I am a sinner against the state...

01:18.840 --> 01:21.173
I am a sinner against the state...

01:22.840 --> 01:25.480
I am a sinner against the state!

01:36.500 --> 01:52.000
When your child was born, you named him Sikong Hen, wishing only that he would never forget the enmity of the nation and the hatred of the family.
